  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Andes Partner Exchange Bolivia and other partner colaboration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to support an Andes partner exchange in Bolivia to exchange learning and experiences about water amongst 10 participating organisations from Peru, Colombia and Bolivia, including visiting local water monitoring and management and its defense in La Paz and Oruro in Bolivia.
The project will also be used for sharing and learning on emergency preparedness and resilience between Bolivian partner Caritas Beni and CAM partners.</narrative>
  </description>
